          "Hadith.3290 - And Muhammad ibn Muslim narrated from Abu Ja'far Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as), who said:\n\"Do not pray behind one who seeks payment for the call to prayer and leading people in prayer, and his testimony is not accepted.\""
